Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 10:14:53 +0100
Subject: message_agent: the bridge's, even in the Bot Chat

Where an MCP server offers its own message_agent (mcp__<server>__message_agent, BipAgents' bridge), the
built-in is not injected, even in a Bot Chat, and a copy added before the MCP tools were listed leaves the
tool list and valid_tool_names: one way to write to an agent. Without such an MCP tool the built-in is
injected as upstream. Patches 0012 and 0016 of the 517b5e10f set, folded.

BipAgents patch, documented in hermes/patches/README.md of the BipAgents repository.

Bip-Patch: 0016-message-agent-the-bridges-everywhere
